WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.602 --> 00:00:08.774
1. In Manage hosting, open WordPress and click Install WordPress.

2
00:00:08.774 --> 00:00:28.389
2. Choose the domain, enter the site title and admin email, then install.

3
00:00:28.389 --> 00:00:30.771
3. When it is ready, use Log in to WP admin. No password needed.

4
00:00:30.771 --> 00:00:48.658
4. To test changes, open the site menu and choose Create staging copy.
